# WorkBuddy skill package — v4.19
# Keep the deliverable lean: exclude local backups, OS cruft, and large PDFs.

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/

# Local backups (kept outside the repo on purpose)
backups/
**/backups/

# Large source PDFs and converted book dumps (not part of the installed skill)
*.pdf
source-*.md
BOOK_OVERVIEW.md
PIPELINE_STATE.md
# 注意：Windows 下 gitignore 大小写不敏感，裸写 GLOSSARY.md 会连
# references/glossary.md（交付物的一部分）一起忽略；故只排除书籍级产物并显式放回交付词典。
books/**/GLOSSARY.md
!references/glossary.md
verified.md
rejected/
candidates/
test-results/
.cangjie/

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
